<title>USA: Lafarge Corp Q3 net falls slightly.</title>
<headline>Lafarge Corp Q3 net falls slightly.</headline>
<dateline>RESTON, Va. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Unaudited and in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>							1996	    1995</p>
<p>Quarter Ended September 30</p>
<p> Net Sales				    $576,264	 $510,459</p>
<p> Net Income				     84,621	   85,875</p>
<p>Net Income Per Common Equity Share</p>
<p>   Primary					  1.21	     1.24</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted				  1.15	     1.19</p>
<p>   Primary Avg Shrs			   70,219	   69,254</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted Avg Shrs		   74,739	   73,774</p>
<p>Nine Months Ended September 30</p>
<p> Net Sales				   1,200,924	1,103,268</p>
<p> Net Income				     89,691	   93,540</p>
<p>Net Income per Common Equity Share</p>
<p>   Primary					  1.28	     1.36</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted				  1.25	     1.35</p>
<p>   Primary Avg Shrs			   69,969	   68,864</p>
<p>   Fully Diluted Avg Shrs		   74,489	   73,384</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q3 and nine month period includes $23.3 million tax credit.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
